                                                                                
 Usage: opentide setup hooks [OPTIONS] [path]                                   
                                                                                
 Configure validate-on-commit hooks (pre-commit config + Git hook).             
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --path     -C                  <str>  Repository path [default: .]           │
│ --install      --no-install           Install .git/hooks/pre-commit when     │
│                                       this path is a Git repository          │
│                                       [default: install]                     │
│ --plan                                List the files each step would write,  │
│                                       and write nothing                      │
│ --yes      -y                         Write without asking for confirmation  │
│ --help                                Show this message and exit.            │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide setup hooks --yes
